      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat currently uses Unity 2017.4 LTS, which does not have the Jobs system.\n\nJobs (and ECS) were introduced in Unity 2018, which does not have an LTS version yet-- therefore, we have not looked into upgrading versions yet.\n\nOnce Unity 2018 LTS is out, we can begin migration to it. Once that is complete, we can look into Jobs/Hybrid ECS for various components, including DB.\n\nThis post will remain open, but I am making this post to let voters know that it is not possible right now, nor will it be possible until we get to 2018 LTS.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
